    1-stranger {0..k-2,N}        span= 200: meas=0.19405 corr=+0.16957 [OK corr<delta]  cap-room=+0.18741
    Sidon-ish                    span=  44: meas=0.01212 corr=-0.01236 [OK corr<delta]  cap-room=+0.36934
    geom2                        span=  64: meas=0.06920 corr=+0.04472 [OK corr<delta]  cap-room=+0.31227
  --- k=9: delta_k=0.35845, consec=0.41616, cap=0.49426 ---
    shifted-AP {0,M..M+k-2}      span=  47: meas=0.30617 corr=+0.24847 [OK corr<delta]  cap-room=+0.18808
    1-stranger {0..k-2,N}        span= 200: meas=0.35959 corr=+0.30189 [OK corr<delta]  cap-room=+0.13466
    Sidon-ish                    span=  65: meas=0.03661 corr=-0.02109 [OK corr<delta]  cap-room=+0.45764
